      "Why inventory API keys during a leaver process?|They may remain independent access paths|Keys always expire with directory login~That depends on how they are bound and validated.|Keys cannot perform business actions~Service credentials can carry substantial capabilities.|Keys are merely public account labels~Many keys are reusable secrets with access authority.|A directory disable does not automatically establish the state of every separately managed credential.",
